Description: A scalable pipeline for identifying genes whose expression patterns define an underlying structure or state within a single-cell population. Version 6.1.4 uses raw counts by default, supports Seurat v4 and v5 assay access, and provides transcriptome-only pseudoclone inference and embedding-based Metaclone analysis.
